        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, slag, unalloyed electr. steel, 0% water, to residual material landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, slag, unalloyed electr. steel, 0% water, to residual material landfill
Inventoried waste contains 100% slag from electric steel production to landfill;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 894adf51-a434-49a7-9bfb-a777a03b45c0
Waste-specific short-term emissions to water from leachate. Long-term emissions from landfill to ground water.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_894adf51-a434-49a7-9bfb-a777a03b45c0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
